OL,5,G0005 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FGail gets a frosty reception in
OL,7,     Fthe rec room, causing Judy to
OL,8,     Fstand up for her. Vera complains
OL,9,     Fto Erica about the working
OL,10,     Fconditions at the factory - for
OL,11,     Fthe officers, not the inmates.
OL,12,G0110 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,13,     FIn Wales, Graeme Hall meets
OL,14,     FLabradoodle Luigi who, despite
OL,15,     Fgiving a stellar stand-up routine
OL,16,     Fon his hind legs, also suffers
OL,17,     Ffrom crippling performance
OL,18,     Fanxiety. Can Graeme help him?
